/**
 * English corrections to the instruction steps of the exercise library.
 *
 * The library's English steps come from a public database
 * (src/data/generatedExerciseLibrary.ts, rewritten by `npm run exercise:sync`),
 * and an audit of all 959 exercises found steps that give advice this app does
 * not: knees held behind the toes, a hard lockout, reps to failure, an upright
 * row to the chin, a bar resting on the neck, pounds and inches, a different
 * exercise than the name, filler and menu text. Nothing can be fixed in the
 * generated file, so the corrected steps live here, keyed by the English name
 * exactly as exerciseInstructionsFiMore.ts is, and getExerciseInstructions
 * returns them instead of the library's own.
 *
 * Where an exercise is listed here its Finnish steps (in either Finnish table)
 * have the same number of steps; a test keeps that pairing.
 *
 * LOADED ON FIRST USE. Like the second Finnish table, this is required only
 * when an exercise is opened, never at module load (the app evaluates every
 * module before the first render). Do not import it from anywhere else; read
 * steps through getExerciseInstructions.
 */
